      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "QUICK CHOICE\nBEHAVIORAL — swap behavior → Strategy\nCREATIONAL — choose one product → Simple Factory | create a matching family → Abstract Factory | configure one complex object → Builder | clone a prepared object → Prototype | enforce one shared instance → Singleton\nSTRUCTURAL — combine objects/classes to form a larger or simpler interface (lessons coming soon)\n\nThese patterns can work together. Start with the smallest pattern that solves the problem.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 17,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "QUICK CHOICE\nBEHAVIORAL — swap behavior → Strategy\nCREATIONAL — choose one product → Simple Factory | create a matching family → Abstract Factory | configure one complex object → Builder | clone a prepared object → Prototype | enforce one shared instance → Singleton\nSTRUCTURAL — combine objects/classes to form a larger or simpler interface (lessons coming soon)\n\nThese patterns can work together. Start with the smallest pattern that solves the problem.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "aH"
    }
